<title>FRANCE: LVMH sets 5.80 Ffr interim dividend.</title>
<headline>LVMH sets 5.80 Ffr interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury goods group LVMH said its board had agreed to pay out on November 29 an interim 1996 dividend of 5.80 francs per share.</p>
<p>&quot;This amount is not indicative of the sum of the dividend for the year,&quot; LVMH said in a statement.</p>
<p>It paid a dividend of 19.25 francs per share for 1995.</p>
<p>The group is expected to report its first-half results on Thursday morning.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
